Rule 21 (layout can be none or a valid layout string, and if specified, ndim of input must be > 0)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : str} |= (v_2 = "none") ∨ (v_2 = "strided" ∧ ndim(v_1) > 0) ∨ (v_2 = "sparse_coo" ∧ ndim(v_1) > 0)
>>
Rule 22 (if device is not none, layout also cannot be none)
{v_1 : str, v_2 : str} |= if v_1 ≠ "none" then v_2 ≠ "none"
